<%- include('partials/head', {
  pageTitle: '同见｜开放的非营利视频共同体',
  pageDescription: '发现并分享采用开放许可的视频作品，在清晰授权下观看、使用和讨论。'
}) %>
<body class="page page--home">
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">跳到主要内容</a>
  <%- include('partials/header', { currentPath: '/' }) %>

  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> 一个由作品连接的公共空间</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">让影像自由流动，<br><em>让创作彼此照亮。</em></h1>
        <p class="hero__lede">上传你愿意开放分享的视频，选定清晰的知识共享许可；用稳定身份参与讨论，不被推荐算法左右。</p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a class="button button--primary" href="/upload">发布一段影像 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#latest-videos">看看大家的作品 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero__manifesto" aria-label="同见原则">
        <p class="hero__manifesto-label">共同约定 / COMMON GROUND</p>
        <ol>
          <li><span>01</span><p><strong>创作者保有选择</strong><small>每段影像都有明确许可</small></p></li>
          <li><span>02</span><p><strong>观看不被计算</strong><small>没有关注数与推荐流</small></p></li>
          <li><span>03</span><p><strong>讨论回到内容</strong><small>持续、克制且平等</small></p></li>
        </ol>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="video-feed shell" id="latest-videos" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
      <header class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> 最近发布</p>
          <h2 id="latest-title">共同观看</h2>
        </div>
        <% if (Array.isArray(videos) && videos.length > 0) { %>
          <p class="section-heading__count"><strong><%= videos.length %></strong> 段公开影像</p>
        <% } %>
      </header>

      <% if (!Array.isArray(videos) || videos.length === 0) { %>
        <div class="empty-state">
          <div class="empty-state__signal" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
          <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> 放映室已就绪</p>
          <h3>第一束光，等你点亮。</h3>
          <p>这里还没有视频。发布第一段采用开放许可的影像，让它成为共同记忆的开始。</p>
          <a class="button button--primary" href="/upload">发布第一个视频</a>
        </div>
      <% } else { %>
        <div class="video-grid">
          <% videos.forEach(function(video, index) {
            const videoId = video.id || video.uuid;
            const licenseCode = video.licenseLabel || video.licenseCode || video.license_code || video.license || '';
            const licenseLabels = {
              'CC0-1.0': 'CC0 1.0',
              'CC-BY-4.0': 'CC BY 4.0',
              'CC-BY-NC-4.0': 'CC BY-NC 4.0',
              'CC-BY-ND-4.0': 'CC BY-ND 4.0',
              'CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0': 'CC BY-NC-ND 4.0'
            };
            const licenseLabel = licenseLabels[licenseCode] || licenseCode || '开放许可';
            const createdValue = video.createdAt || video.created_at;
            let formattedDate = '';
            if (createdValue) {
              const parsedDate = new Date(createdValue);
              formattedDate = Number.isNaN(parsedDate.getTime())
                ? String(createdValue)
                : new Intl.DateTimeFormat('zh-CN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'short', day: 'numeric' }).format(parsedDate);
            }
            const description = typeof video.description === 'string' ? video.description.trim() : '';
            const accountDisplayName = video.accountDisplayName || video.account_display_name || video.uploaderDisplayName || video.uploader_display_name || '';
            const accountUsername = video.accountUsername || video.account_username || video.uploaderUsername || video.uploader_username || '';
            const accountLabel = accountDisplayName || accountUsername;
            const codecLabels = { avc: 'H.264', hevc: 'HEVC', vp9: 'VP9', av1: 'AV1', unknown: 'LEGACY' };
            const formatLabel = `${codecLabels[video.videoCodec || video.video_codec] || 'VIDEO'} / ${(video.container || 'mp4').toUpperCase()}`;
          %>
            <article class="video-card">
              <a class="video-card__visual" href="/videos/<%= videoId %>" aria-label="播放《<%= video.title %>》">
                <span class="video-card__number" aria-hidden="true"><%= String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span>
                <span class="video-card__rings" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
                <span class="play-button" aria-hidden="true">▶</span>
                <span class="video-card__format"><%= formatLabel %> / OPEN VIDEO</span>
              </a>
              <div class="video-card__body">
                <div class="video-card__meta">
                  <span class="license-pill"><%= licenseLabel %></span>
                  <% if (formattedDate) { %><time datetime="<%= createdValue %>"><%= formattedDate %></time><% } %>
                </div>
                <h3><a href="/videos/<%= videoId %>"><%= video.title %></a></h3>
                <p class="video-card__creator">由 <strong><%= video.creator %></strong> 创作</p>
                <% if (accountLabel) { %>
                  <p class="video-card__account">由 <strong><%= accountLabel %></strong><% if (accountUsername && accountUsername !== accountLabel) { %> <span>@<%= accountUsername %></span><% } %> 发布</p>
                <% } %>
                <% if (description) { %><p class="video-card__description"><%= description %></p><% } %>
                <a class="video-card__watch" href="/videos/<%= videoId %>">观看与讨论 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
              </div>
            </article>
          <% }); %>
        </div>
      <% } %>
    </section>

    <section class="principles shell" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> 为什么是同见</p>
      <h2 id="principles-title">分享，不必交换隐私。</h2>
      <div class="principles__grid">
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">◎</span><h3>稳定身份</h3><p>观看始终开放；注册后使用持续账号发布与回应，不要求真实姓名。</p></article>
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">◇</span><h3>许可先行</h3><p>五种开放许可一目了然，让创作者与使用者都知道边界。</p></article>
        <article><span aria-hidden="true">∿</span><h3>原码流通</h3><p>浏览器只在需要时无损重封装，服务器验证完整性，但不会重新编码你的画面与声音。</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
